  note      = "Publisher Copyright: {\textcopyright} 2015 IEEE. Copyright: Copyright 2016 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.; 37th Annual International Conference of the IEEE Engineering in Medicine and Biology Society, EMBC 2015 ; Conference date: 25-08-2015 Through 29-08-2015",
